# Tests

## Layout

- Integration tests: `tests/` package
- Unit tests: `*_test.go` next to source in `internal/`

## Integration test harness

Use `tests/harness/` — do not build ad-hoc test environments.

```go
sb := harness.New(t)          // creates sandbox, calls t.Parallel()
repo := sb.AddRepo("docs")
sb.AddPipeline("backup_docs").Backup("PC", []string{src}, repo)
_, err := sb.Run(ctx, "backup", "--all")
require.NoError(t, err)
```

Reference: `tests/harness/sandbox.go`, `tests/backup_test.go`

## Conventions

- Each test: `context.WithTimeout`, `require.*` assertions
- Tests run the built `bin/crestic` binary — do not mock restic
- New CLI command: add an isolation test following `tests/check_test.go`, `tests/forget_test.go`

## CI

- Unit: `go test $(go list ./... | grep -v '/tests$')`
- Integration: `go test ./tests/...` (requires restic installed)
- See `.github/workflows/ci.yaml`
